		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Colossal serpent swallowing its own tail, comprised of nigh-infinite small serpents.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 59, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 bite +0 (1d4 + poison), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> -4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Hypnotic Coils</strong>. Mortals within far, WIS 15+ or gaze in awe at ouroboros's rhythmic coils for 1d4 rounds. On success, immune for 24 hours</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or go to 0 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Regeneration</strong>. Unless reduced to 0 HP, regains 4d6 HP on its turn while consuming itself.</p><p></p><p><strong>Ruinous Blood</strong>. Creatures striking ouroboros in melee, CHA 15+ or cursed, transform into venomous snake swarm.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
